                                                "sense_id": "bc63c6fb-1f68-316b-afd4-5e2da9fc8f51",
                                                "text": "Accompanying the article was a drawing: a chambermaid gripped the long wooden handle of a warming pan that projected rudely from between a tailcoated gentleman’s legs."
                                            }
                                        ]
